### 1. Register Customer
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/customers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "a@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "address": "Ha Noi"
}

### 2. Customer not found -> 404
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/customers/99

### 3. Login
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/customers/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 4. Create Product
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Asus",
  "price": 20000000,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "description": "Laptop van phong"
}

### 5. Product validation -> 400
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -500,
  "stockQuantity": -1,
  "description": "Invalid"
}

### 6. Get Products
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/products

### 7. Create Order
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 8. Invalid quantity -> 400
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 0
}

### 9. Get Order
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/orders/1
